WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:03.103 line:8%
VICTOR BLACKWELL: This
is personal for me.

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:06.539 line:8%
Congressman Elijah Cummings,
as my mother puts it,

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.541 line:8%
is one of the people
who gives you keys.

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:13.846
He's given me keys at different
points throughout my life.

00:00:13.947 --> 00:00:18.684 line:8%
For most of my life, he was the
representative of my community,

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.954 line:14%
home district, Maryland 7.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.289
And I first met
Congressman Cummings

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:26.192
when I was 16 years old.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:29.728
He had started this new youth
program, Elijah Cummings Youth

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:34.934
Program in Israel, where a few
students were chosen to travel

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:37.803
to Israel for close
to a month to learn

00:00:37.904 --> 00:00:39.738
about the culture and religion.

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:43.743
At the airport, he showed up to
say goodbye and wish us well.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.110
And I remember
something he said.

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:47.413
He said, open yourself up.

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:48.915
Make the possibility.

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:50.983
Create the possibility
of learning,

00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:54.820
meeting someone, thinking of
things in a different way.

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:55.655
I've kept that.

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.624
That's one of those little keys.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:00:59.959 line:8%
Congressman Cummings
was also the speaker

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.494 line:14%
at my high school graduation.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:05.598 line:8%
And he told his story of his
personal and professional life.

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:11.070 line:8%
And I remember him saying,
never let anyone define you.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:12.939 line:14%
He said that so many times.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.673 line:8%
ELIJAH CUMMINGS: Don't let
them take away your hope.

00:01:14.774 --> 00:01:16.476 line:14%
I don't care who they are.

00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.111 line:8%
And let no one
define you-- no one.

00:01:19.212 --> 00:01:21.013
VICTOR BLACKWELL: Now,
I'm sitting there as,

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:25.318
at that point, a 17-year-old
who wanted to be on television,

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.253
to be a TV journalist.

00:01:27.353 --> 00:01:31.391
There was nobody on
television with my build.

00:01:31.491 --> 00:01:33.893
I didn't know any
openly gay television

00:01:33.993 --> 00:01:35.595
reporters or anchors.

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:39.165
But 20 years into
this business now,

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:42.034
that key from
Congressman Cummings--

00:01:42.135 --> 00:01:44.770
never let anyone define you--

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.438
has led me to this point.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:47.373
Thank you.

00:01:47.474 --> 00:01:49.742
In 2017, I was
invited back to be

00:01:49.843 --> 00:01:53.947
part of the celebration
of 20 years of the Elijah

00:01:54.047 --> 00:01:55.514
Cummings Youth Program.

00:01:55.615 --> 00:01:57.950
The congressman
recorded a video.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:01.687
And to hear him speak about
us, to speak about me in a way,

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:05.391
I knew that this was
a personal investment.

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:07.193
ELIJAH CUMMINGS: And
Victor, your ears

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:10.163
should be burning because
there's not a week that goes

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:15.001
by that I don't talk about
you and how proud I am to know

00:02:15.101 --> 00:02:18.504
that a young man who
grew up in a neighborhood

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:26.212
similar to the one I live in now
has gone on to be a CNN anchor.

00:02:26.312 --> 00:02:29.014
VICTOR BLACKWELL: In 2019, when
the former president tweeted

00:02:29.115 --> 00:02:32.084
that Congressman Cummings
district, my hometown,

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:36.088
was a "rat-infested place where
no human would want to live,"

00:02:36.189 --> 00:02:37.023
that was personal.

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:38.124
It was offensive.

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:41.394
And all of Baltimore
was outraged by that.

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:44.731
ELIJAH CUMMINGS: Do
not just criticize us,

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.732
but come to Baltimore,
and I promise you,

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:47.967
you will be welcome.

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.635
VICTOR BLACKWELL: Another key--

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:51.937
another key from the
congressman in the way

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:54.640
that he responded
to that vitriol

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:58.311
with grace and hospitality.

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:01.847
Congressman Cummings died
just a few months after that.

00:03:01.948 --> 00:03:04.616
Some of those keys that
opened a lot of doors

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:07.787
and helped me throughout my life
are the ones that Congressman

00:03:07.887 --> 00:03:09.188
Cummings gave me.

00:03:09.289 --> 00:03:13.292
And I think a lot of people
have received those keys.

00:03:13.393 --> 00:03:17.063
- (SINGING) I'm gonna
let it shine, let it--

